Exit Code 2` 主动终止。\n1. **故障发生机制**：日志记录表明，应用在处理 `/work` 时捕获到致命错误，记录了 HTTP 500 状态码并输出 `\"runtime process exiting\"`（证据 #3）；流量数据独立确认了这些请求返回 500（证据 #4）。\n2. **状态维持机制**：Kubernetes 监控到容器非正常退出（`last_exit_code=2`，证据 #1），触发了标准的重启策略。由于代码中的逻辑缺陷未被修复，进程在重启后再次崩溃，进而进入 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（证据 #1, #5）。\n\n**未确认因素**：\n具体引发 `/work` 请求返回 500 的底层业务逻辑缺陷或 Python 异常堆栈，在现有日志输出中未被完整捕获（unknowns），因此无法进一步细化根因的具体代码行，但已充分证实“进程主动异常退出导致重启”这一核心故障链路。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 25.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 101.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c: 101.5s (Evidence 92.0s, RCA 9.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 141.3, "metrics": {"run_id": "52f48d2cb7084bf3", "mttr": {"value": "2.4m", "seconds": 141.3061294555664, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crash